### 基础对话
GET http://localhost:8080/chat?message=请用一句话介绍 Spring AI

### 流式对话
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/stream?message=请讲一个简短的故事
Accept: text/event-stream

### 带错误处理的对话
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/safe?message=什么是 ChatClient

### 请求级温度参数
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/creative?message=请写一首四行短诗&temperature=1.2

### 空白输入：预期中文 HTTP 400
GET http://localhost:8080/chat?message=%20

### 非有限温度：预期中文 HTTP 400
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/creative?message=你好&temperature=NaN
